# POLLY, COMPUTER AUDIO (Setup's SEL list, after USB AUDIO): on, the computer plays through the FM-1 over USB (fm1-base's
# usb_audio_out at plat_usb_play_gain's unity, times MASTER); off (the default), muted. The USB recording never holds
# the computer's audio either way (fm1-base's tests/uac_mix_test.c). Kept with the settings; said by a reader
wait 300
expect pc_audio 0
expect usb_play_gain 0
listen
tap GLO
tap SEL
expect list_open 1
turn SELECT 2
wait 300
said COMPUTER AUDIO off, 7 of 7
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said COMPUTER AUDIO on
expect pc_audio 1
expect dirty 1
expect usb_play_gain 4096
expect usb_full 0
shot computer_audio.png
turn ALGO -1
wait 300
said COMPUTER AUDIO off
expect pc_audio 0
expect usb_play_gain 0
turn ALGO 1
tap HOME
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect pc_audio 1
expect usb_play_gain 4096
